{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7v9fjppr","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":48,"title":"Was macht dir Spaß?","nativeTitle":"What Do You Enjoy?","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Max","Inge","Nico"],"speakerGenders":{"Max":"male","Inge":"female","Nico":"male"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Max","target":"So! Zwei Schnitzel à la Tarek.","native":"So! Two schnitzels à la Tarek."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Danke schön, Max. Sehr nett.","native":"Thank you very much, Max. Very kind."},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Lasst es euch schmecken.","native":"Enjoy your meal."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Guten Appetit , Nico.","native":"Enjoy your meal, Nico."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Guten Appetit, Inge.","native":"Enjoy your meal, Inge."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Ich hab gehört, du spielst Fußball?","native":"I heard you play soccer?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ja, stimmt.","native":"Yes, that's right."},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Bald spielst du mit uns zusammen Fußball. Nächste Woche!","native":"Soon you'll be playing soccer with us. Next week!"},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Was machst du denn noch in deiner Freizeit ? Joggst du gerne?","native":"What else do you do in your free time? Do you like jogging?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Nein, ich jogge nicht gern. Aber ich schwimme manchmal. Ich höre viel Musik und fahre viel Fahrrad. Aber am liebsten mache ich … das da ...","native":"No, I don't like jogging. But I sometimes swim. I listen to a lot of music and ride my bike a lot. But what I like doing most is … that there ..."},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Angeln ? Du angelst gern?","native":"Fishing? You like fishing?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Angeln, ja. Ich gehe gern angeln.","native":"Fishing, yes. I like going fishing."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Na, das ist ja was! Ihr beiden angelt doch auch!","native":"Well, how about that! You two fish too!"},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Wenn wir Zeit haben. Wir gehen auch gern ins Theater und ins Kino, aber am liebsten angeln wir. Komm mal her, ich zeig dir mal ’n paar Fotos. Ich suche die Fotos von letztem Jahr. Das war … verrückt. Erst hab ich gar nichts gefangen, wollte schon aufgeben, und dann zieht es und heraus kam ein riesiger Hecht. Irgendwo müssen die Fotos sein …","native":"When we have time. We also like going to the theater and to the movies, but we like fishing most of all. Come here, I'll show you a few photos. I'm looking for the photos from last year. That was … crazy. At first I caught nothing at all, I was about to give up, and then it pulls and a huge pike came out. The photos must be somewhere …"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Das ist Yara!","native":"That's Yara!"},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Du kennst Yara?","native":"You know Yara?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Das ist meine Tante!","native":"That's my aunt!"},{"speaker":"Max","target":"Yara ist deine Tante?","native":"Yara is your aunt?"},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ja, meine Tante.","native":"Yes, my aunt."}],"teach":null,"wordData":null,"progress":{"teach":false,"full":false,"practice":null},"createdAt":1795063529493,"updatedAt":1795063529521},"course":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","name":"Nicos Weg","level":"","from":"","to":"German","createdAt":1795063529520,"custom":true},"pack":{"v":1,"lines":{"0":{"f":"So! Zwei Schnitzel à la Tarek.","fn":"So! Two schnitzels à la Tarek."},"1":{"f":"Danke schön, Max. Sehr nett.","fn":"Thank you very much, Max. Very kind."},"2":{"f":"Lasst es euch schmecken.","fn":"Enjoy your meal."},"3":{"f":"Guten Appetit , Nico.","fn":"Enjoy your meal, Nico."},"4":{"f":"Guten Appetit, Inge.","fn":"Enjoy your meal, Inge."},"5":{"f":"Ich hab gehört, du spielst Fußball?","fn":"I heard you play soccer?"},"6":{"f":"Ja, stimmt.","fn":"Yes, that's right."},"7":{"f":"Bald spielst du mit uns zusammen Fußball. Nächste Woche!","fn":"Soon you'll be playing soccer with us. Next week!"},"8":{"f":"Was machst du denn noch in deiner Freizeit ? Joggst du gerne?","fn":"What else do you do in your free time? Do you like jogging?"},"9":{"f":"Nein, ich jogge nicht gern. Aber ich schwimme manchmal. Ich höre viel Musik und fahre viel Fahrrad. Aber am liebsten mache ich … das da ...","fn":"No, I don't like jogging. But I sometimes swim. I listen to a lot of music and ride my bike a lot. But what I like doing most is … that there ..."},"10":{"f":"Angeln ? Du angelst gern?","fn":"Fishing? You like fishing?"},"11":{"f":"Angeln, ja. Ich gehe gern angeln.","fn":"Fishing, yes. I like going fishing."},"12":{"f":"Na, das ist ja was! Ihr beiden angelt doch auch!","fn":"Well, how about that! You two fish too!"},"13":{"f":"Wenn wir Zeit haben. Wir gehen auch gern ins Theater und ins Kino, aber am liebsten angeln wir. Komm mal her, ich zeig dir mal ’n paar Fotos. Ich suche die Fotos von letztem Jahr. Das war … verrückt. Erst hab ich gar nichts gefangen, wollte schon aufgeben, und dann zieht es und heraus kam ein riesiger Hecht. Irgendwo müssen die Fotos sein …","fn":"When we have time. We also like going to the theater and to the movies, but we like fishing most of all. Come here, I'll show you a few photos. I'm looking for the photos from last year. That was … crazy. At first I caught nothing at all, I was about to give up, and then it pulls and a huge pike came out. The photos must be somewhere …"},"14":{"f":"Das ist Yara!","fn":"That's Yara!"},"15":{"f":"Du kennst Yara?","fn":"You know Yara?"},"16":{"f":"Das ist meine Tante!","fn":"That's my aunt!"},"17":{"f":"Yara ist deine Tante?","fn":"Yara is your aunt?"},"18":{"f":"Ja, meine Tante.","fn":"Yes, my aunt."}},"xt":{},"words":[{"lang":"de-de","word":"es","engine":"edge","voice":"de-DE-ConradNeural","dataUrl":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},{"lang":"de-de","word":"bald","engine":"edge","voice":"de-DE-ConradNeural","dataUrl":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},{"lang":"de-de","word":"Ich","engine":"gttsapi","voice":"de","dataUrl":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"}]}}